<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Refund Policy | Primeserve GST Document Centre</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/brand.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/portal.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/customer.css"></head><body><header class="brand-header"><div class="brand-wrap header-inner"><a href="/"><img class="brand-logo-image" src="/primeserve-logo.png" alt="Primeserve"></a></div></header><main class="workspace customer-workspace"><section class="portal-card"><h1>Refund Policy</h1><p>To request a wallet refund, you must complete <strong>both</strong> steps:</p><ol><li>Submit a Refund Request from My Account in the portal.</li><li>Email complete details and a valid reason to <a href="mailto:support@primeserve.in">support@primeserve.in</a>, quoting the portal refund request ID.</li></ol><p>Include your full name, registered email, company name, original payment UTR/reference, requested amount, refund UPI ID and reason. Do not send passwords, OTPs or UPI PINs. The portal does not send this email for you. A portal request without the required email will not be approved.</p><p>Only eligible unused paid wallet credits can be considered. Signup bonuses, promotional and Admin-granted credits are not refundable. API charges and unresolved API reservations reduce the eligible amount; pending recharge submissions do not count as paid credits. Usage is allocated against paid credits first when calculating eligibility.</p><p>Requested funds are held and unavailable for API use during review. Admin checks the payment records, remaining eligible balance and reason, then decides the final approved amount, which may be lower than requested, or rejects the request. Any unapproved amount is released back to the wallet.</p><p>After approval, Admin manually transfers the approved amount to the verified destination and records the transfer reference. Approval alone does not mean money has been sent. You can view the decision and payment status in My Account. No refund is sent automatically and no completion time is guaranteed before review.</p><a href="/account">Back to My Account</a></section></main><?= view('brand_footer') ?></body></html>